WEBVTT

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.260
It's a vampire!

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:31.480
Are you boys hurt?

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:33.070
Huh? N-No.

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:37.620
Then, I will return to the station.
Have the VRC collect the body.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.870
Right!

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:40.080
Roger that!

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.660
I'm leaving it to you.

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:46.250
What is she?

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:49.540
She's a monster. She's an elite member
of the Vampire Control Division.

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:51.210
Elite?

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:54.470
She skipped a grade and was the
youngest person to ever join the force.

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:57.180
A supernova who became
vice-captain right away.

00:00:57.180 --> 00:01:01.430
In battle, there's no one better.
She's the ace of aces.

00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:07.690
Wow... Someone like that will
definitely have a successful career.

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:39.610
"Shin-Yokohama Police Station"

00:02:39.610 --> 00:02:43.530
"Shin-Yokohama Police Station"
"Highway to Success, Path to Failure"

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:46.040
"Vampire Control Division"

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:46.040
I have read your written request.

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:47.040
The vampire, Draluc, huh? Hmm...

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:50.460
"Kanagawa Prefectural Police
Vampire Control Division"
"Captain - Hiyoshi"

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:50.460
The vampire, Draluc, huh? Hmm...

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:53.170
I don't think he's that impressive
of an opponent, though.

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:55.670
Captain, you can't take him lightly!

00:02:55.670 --> 00:02:59.130
He's a vampire lord who has been
around for over 200 years!

00:02:59.130 --> 00:03:02.430
Losing his stronghold at the end
of his fight with Ronaldo

00:03:02.430 --> 00:03:05.560
could also be seen as how
he got close to him.

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:12.060
Above all, I don't believe a vampire
who would do <i>that </i>is a simple weakling.

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:15.770
He's hiding his true self.
The threat is still unknown!

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:17.690
Please allow me...

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:20.900
Please allow me to conduct surveillance
on the vampire, Draluc!

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:25.160
The vampire, Draluc...

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:29.080
If I observe him from the shadows,
he might show his true colors.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.370
There he is.

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:32.080
Man, I'm hungry.

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:35.000
Jeez, I can't believe there's
nothing in the frid--

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:39.170
He died!

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:41.170
Why did he die right after
leaving the building?!

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:41.550
"Poison Swamp"

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:41.550
Why did he die right after
leaving the building?!

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:43.800
"Poison Swamp"

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:43.800
Did he step in a poison swamp?

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:47.470
N-No... could he really just be weak?

00:03:47.470 --> 00:03:50.480
But really, why did he die?

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:55.980
Wait, if there's a reason for his death...
There's no doubt about it!

00:03:55.980 --> 00:04:00.150
He's guessed that he's being watched
and he's pretending to be weak!

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:01.530
In order to keep humans

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:04.160
from being suspicious
after he's gotten close to them.

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:07.910
Anyone else might've gotten tricked
and stopped the investigation.

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:12.040
I can't believe he's making me think
so much just with his normal life!

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:16.710
Be that as it may, that hunter, Ronaldo,
has really let his guard down.

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:20.050
Idiot... Ronaldo, you are a fool!

00:04:20.050 --> 00:04:22.970
I'll follow them while
keeping my distance.

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:26.140
If Draluc puts up his antenna,
he might notice me.

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:34.350
Where are those two going?

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:35.730
Sand!

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:38.230
Oh, a dog barked?

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:40.280
Sand!

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:42.360
A woman tackled him?

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:43.320
Here you go.

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:43.990
Thanks.

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:45.490
Here you go.

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:46.360
Here you go.

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:47.160
Sand?!

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:49.580
What was that? Why did he die just now?!

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:54.330
He's making himself look weak
to the people around town, too?

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:56.580
He's thorough.

00:04:56.580 --> 00:05:01.170
Which means... he's aiming to
control this whole town?!

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:04.380
And pretending to be weak
is the prep work for that?!

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:06.180
So cunning...

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:10.310
Their destination is that supermarket?

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:14.230
Hey, what happened to Draluc?!

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:17.060
I can't believe you left him alone,
Ronaldo, you fool!

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:18.690
Damn it, where's Draluc?!

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:21.230
Oh, it's the Damn Weak Old Man!

00:05:21.230 --> 00:05:22.980
--He dies really fast!
--Stupid!

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:24.940
He looks like he'd talk like a rich snob!

00:05:24.940 --> 00:05:26.910
He's been stopped by grade schoolers!

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:28.620
--Sand...
--And he's dead!

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:32.990
And he's just ignoring it!
What? Does this just happen a lot?

00:05:32.990 --> 00:05:36.710
Th-There's a limit to how much
someone can pretend to be weak.

00:05:36.710 --> 00:05:38.790
Why did he die, anyway?

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:42.750
It's not like he'd die because he
was hurt by the kids' insults...

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:44.010
Don't tell me--!

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:49.800
Did he die to keep the children
from getting hurt by his great power?

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:50.720
No way...

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:55.020
Even that cold-blooded, inhuman vampire
has a warm heart he can't abandon.

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:57.640
In other words,
is there love in his heart?!

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:59.060
--Wait, Mister--!

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:01.060
--I cannot kill a child.
--Wait, Mister--!

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:04.190
Damn it, I can't read him!

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:09.320
But at this rate, I don't think
I'll be able to see his true--

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:10.740
That's...

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:11.370
"Inferior Vampire - Big Mosquito"

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.330
"Inferior Vampire - Big Mosquito"

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.330
...a Big Mosquito?

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:15.500
I'll hunt--

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:22.170
No, it's a good chance to see his power!
Now what will you do, Vampire Draluc?!

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:26.630
Hm? A mosquito?!

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:28.970
Draluc Do-or-Die Punch!

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:29.970
Sand!

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:32.600
Draluc Mach-Speed Dash!

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:34.180
Don't come here!

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:37.680
Sand...!

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:41.350
Mosquito...!

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:43.150
John Guard!

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:52.910
Oh, Ronaldo, good j-- Sand!

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:55.410
Idiot! I can't believe
you used John as a shield!

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:58.120
W-Wait! For John, that level of attack

00:06:58.120 --> 00:07:00.290
is like sticking a toothpick
into orichalcum​--

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:03.290
How can you blindly believe
in John's hardness?!

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:04.420
Oh, it's Ronaldo!

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:06.340
--You're red!
--Let's kick him! Kick!

00:07:06.340 --> 00:07:08.840
Hey, grade schoolers! Scram!

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:12.970
Go home! It's nighttime!
You're so loud! Go home!

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:14.970
Go home to your mommies!

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:20.600
I was the fool...!

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:27.650
Oh, you're back, Hinaichi!

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:31.110
Rejoice. Your request was granted.

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:33.490
I talked to the chief after that,

00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:35.700
and he said that if you thought
this vampire was so important,

00:07:35.700 --> 00:07:38.200
then we couldn't leave it alone.

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:43.750
So your mission is to monitor and
investigate the vampire, Draluc.

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:46.590
We'll keep counting on you.

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:51.590
Now, to get down to business, can you give
me a report of today's investigation?

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:55.350
Yes.

00:07:57.100 --> 00:08:00.020
"Ridiculous Hunter Guild"

00:08:00.020 --> 00:08:02.020
"The War Chronicles of Ronaldo"
"Ridiculous Hunter Guild"

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:05.730
Oh, the second volume of
<i>The Ronaldo Chronicles </i>is out?

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:07.940
Yeah, somehow.

00:08:07.940 --> 00:08:11.320
I guess it was worth being
thrown in the maiden.

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:13.860
Don't remind me about that!

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:17.620
I should stop by the guild
and do some PR for this.

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:18.660
Guild?

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:22.500
The Hunters Guild that all the
hunters around here belong to.

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:24.580
It's like a gathering place for hunters.

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:27.920
You can get jobs there
and trade information.

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:29.420
Oh? Have a good time.

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:31.590
Idiot! I'm introducing you to everyone!

00:08:31.590 --> 00:08:34.380
<i>Me</i>, at a gathering of hunters?!

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:37.850
Wait, I haven't thought of an autograph
yet... This is kind of sudden...

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:40.270
It's not a welcome party or anything!

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:42.770
Why should the hunters
welcome you, anyway?!

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:44.190
You have flowers growing between
those ears or something?

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:45.900
Does my hair look okay?

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:49.610
You've always looked like
Sally the Witch's dad, moron!

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:53.780
Oh, so this is the hunters' lair, huh?

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:55.700
Don't make it sound so sketchy!

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:57.490
"Shin-Yokohama Highball"?

00:08:57.490 --> 00:08:59.950
It's the guild master's side job.

00:08:59.950 --> 00:09:02.160
Hey, I'm coming in.

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:07.040
Hello, welcome.

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:09.590
"Guild Master - Gosetsu"

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:09.590
It's been a while, Ronaldo.

00:09:09.590 --> 00:09:11.170
"Guild Master - Gosetsu"

00:09:09.590 --> 00:09:11.170
Long time no see, Master.

00:09:11.170 --> 00:09:11.550
"The War Chronicles of Ronaldo"

00:09:11.170 --> 00:09:11.550
Long time no see, Master.

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:13.550
"The War Chronicles of Ronaldo"

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:13.550
Here's volume 2 of <i>The Ronaldo Chronicles</i>.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:17.720
Thanks for your consideration.
I'll display it here again.

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:20.680
Is that man the vampire in question?

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:22.520
The damn weak one that's
always messing around.

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:25.440
Why, hello! I'm the vampire, Draluc.

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:28.100
This place feels like the dressing
room of unpopular comedians.

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:29.230
You idiot!

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:31.110
Shut up! Don't say that we're unpopular!

00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:33.110
In a profession like this, it all depends
on how much we stand out.

00:09:33.110 --> 00:09:35.820
Our costume fees also add up, damn it!

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:37.160
Yeah, they add up.

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:39.320
There are a bunch of people
just like Ronaldo.

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:41.870
Tape that mouth shut, you octopus!

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:45.710
That's a weird vampire, though,
to be teaming up with you.

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:47.210
It's like fratricide, isn't it?

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:50.210
Fratricide? How rude.

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:54.800
The only ones we consider brethren
are those who are of the same blood.

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:56.300
And those of my blood believe

00:09:56.300 --> 00:10:00.430
the human society convenient and
useful to us should be preserved.

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:02.310
So it is our desire for
the inferior vampires

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:06.480
and foolish compatriots who harm
that society to be driven away!

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:10.860
Well, in other words,
it seems fun, so we'll help.

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:13.360
You should be very grateful.

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:16.820
It's kind of refreshing
that he's so shameless.

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:20.490
Until I finish my business,
don't move or talk. Just die.

00:10:20.490 --> 00:10:22.870
Okay, okay, I get it.
You're so high-strung.

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:24.240
--Listen, while I'm talking to Master--

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:25.290
--Good evening.
--Listen, while I'm talking to Master--

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:28.160
Why are you wearing a baseball uniform?

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:29.290
Is that what you like?

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:34.000
Hey! I told you to die!
Don't stick your nose in his business!

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.630
But I was curious. It's you hunters' fault for
being such a funny band of merrymakers.

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:37.670
I'll kill you!

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:38.260
Nice to meet you! I'm Homerun Batter.
I'm a hunter who fights with a bat and ball!

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:42.050
"Home Run King of the Hunter World"
"Homerun Batter"

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:42.050
Nice to meet you! I'm Homerun Batter.
I'm a hunter who fights with a bat and ball!

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:45.100
"Home Run King of the Hunter World"
"Homerun Batter"

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:45.100
The bat's fine, but fighting
with a ball is really hard!

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:47.640
You don't have to be nice to him, Batter!

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:50.100
Oh, what was your name again? The arm guy.

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:52.150
Oh, um, I'm Satet--

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:53.570
Stop wandering around!

00:10:53.570 --> 00:10:53.650
What's that you're wearing?
How about taking it off?

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:56.530
"Vampire Hunter"
"[Great Leek Chop] Vampfetch"

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:56.530
What's that you're wearing?
How about taking it off?

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:58.450
"Vampire Hunter"
"[Great Leek Chop] Vampfetch"

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:58.450
Stop playing around!

00:10:58.450 --> 00:11:04.740
Don't be rude, idiot! Vampfetch is
a really strong and popular hunter!

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:07.410
Oh, my, Ronaldo. It's been a while!

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:09.330
Oh, is this another hunter?

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:14.540
Who's this? He's so cute!

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:15.090
This is that vampire, right?
Oh, dear, he's so sweet! What a coup!

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:18.670
"Vampire Trainer"
"Senya Siriski"

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:18.670
This is that vampire, right?
Oh, dear, he's so sweet! What a coup!

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:21.260
"Vampire Trainer"
"Senya Siriski"

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:21.260
Ronaldo, what's with this scary person?!

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:25.010
That's the vampire trainer, Senya Siriski.

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:27.140
This is a hunter who hunts down vampires,

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:29.390
catches them, and trains them
to match his tastes.

00:11:29.390 --> 00:11:30.980
So scary!

00:11:30.980 --> 00:11:34.270
Your too-pale skin and emaciated body
are also right in my strike zone!

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:35.940
Even the ashes you turn
into feel high-class!

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:38.740
No! Please stop! Please stop!

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:41.280
Ronaldo, give him to me!

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:43.280
--Sure.
--Ronaldo!

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:46.160
This isn't funny! You teamed up
with me, didn't you?!

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:50.500
Shut up! We're disbanding. I was getting
tired of protecting you, anyway!

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:54.040
You can leave John to me,
and let Senya take good care of you!

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:56.170
That settles it! Then, hurry up
and change into this!

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:58.420
No way! Is that a uniform?!

00:11:58.420 --> 00:12:02.260
Senya, you're being too pushy.
You can't just break up a team like that.

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:06.180
Oh, thanks, person who didn't
really do anything the other day!

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:13.190
Now, now, Ronaldo, you shouldn't be
so quick to dissolve your team, either.

00:12:13.190 --> 00:12:16.060
What do you think about
leaving this to me...

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:21.360
...and holding a Senya vs. Ronaldo,
Battle for Draluc Match?

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:24.950
My fate is being decided by a side show?!

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:29.040
As for the rules, let's have the first
to win three matches take the prize.

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:29.580
"Prize"

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:29.580
As for the rules, let's have the first
to win three matches take the prize.

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:34.580
"Prize"

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:34.580
We'll have the contestants take turns
deciding what to do for each event.

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:38.290
All right, place your bets here.
No pushing please. It's a one-drink system.

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:40.420
Master's business spirit is strong!

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:43.970
Men first! I'll let you
choose the first event.

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:45.680
Then, arm wrestling.

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:47.220
You're a man, too, aren't you?

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:49.810
Contestants, to your places...

00:12:49.810 --> 00:12:52.180
Ready... fight!

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:53.140
Oh, no, I lost.

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:54.810
Ronaldo!

00:12:54.810 --> 00:12:57.060
Man, Senya, you sure are
strong. I can't beat you.

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:59.730
Ronaldo!

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:01.400
No...!

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:03.820
Ronaldo, you brute!

00:13:03.820 --> 00:13:07.280
Making it Senya's fault is a good excuse.

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:10.200
I can have some peace and quiet
at the office now. Later, Lord Dral.

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:11.620
You're not even trying.

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:12.790
Put up a fight, idiot!

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:14.040
Do you have any balls?!

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:15.830
Hey, bystanders should be quiet!

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:20.000
That bastard's definitely just looking
for a reason to be rid of me.

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.800
Th-This is bad. I need to do something!

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:23.260
"Senya vs. Ronaldo"
"Battle for Vampire Match!!"

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:24.670
"Senya vs. Ronaldo"
"Battle for Vampire Match!!"

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:24.670
Circle.

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:27.260
Now, what should we do
for the second match?

00:13:27.260 --> 00:13:29.600
Let's see, how about poker?

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:31.600
Then, I will be the dealer.

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:33.430
Poker...

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:38.810
It's your turn, Ronaldo.

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:43.190
All right, I can lose with this hand.

00:13:43.190 --> 00:13:44.780
Will you draw?

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:46.740
No, I'll keep my hand.

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:50.080
Whoops! My foot slipped!

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:53.620
Don't get in the way!
Stay back, you idiot!

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:55.500
I'll open your cards, then.

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:57.960
Oh, a full house. That was a good hand.

00:13:57.960 --> 00:13:58.920
What?!

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:01.290
Yes! Nice, John.

00:14:02.840 --> 00:14:05.470
But I have four of a kind!

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:08.130
That was just a really good hand!

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:13.350
That bastard. Did he do something?

00:14:13.350 --> 00:14:15.270
Heh. Well, he messed up.

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:19.100
Even if you regret cocky actions,
it's too late now, Lord Dr--

00:14:22.070 --> 00:14:25.110
"Mr. Fukuma"

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:28.820
Yes, thank you for waiting!
This is Ronaldo!

00:14:28.820 --> 00:14:30.700
Hello, Ronaldo.

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:33.700
I have some good news regarding
<i>The Ronaldo Chronicles </i>volume 2.

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:34.830
Good news?

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:36.080
Yes.

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:39.500
Your teamwork with that
vampire was well-received.

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:42.710
The editor-in-chief wants you
to write more along those lines.

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:45.840
--So let's make your team
hunting with Draluc

00:14:45.840 --> 00:14:46.420
--Let's go, Dral.
--So let's make your team
hunting with Draluc

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:47.090
--Let's go, Dral.
--a focal point for <i>The Ronaldo</i>
<i>Chronicles </i>from now on.

00:14:47.090 --> 00:14:49.510
--Okay, Ron.
--a focal point for <i>The Ronaldo</i>
<i>Chronicles </i>from now on.

00:14:49.510 --> 00:14:53.810
I'm looking forward to it, too.
We're counting on you.

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:55.270
Goodbye.

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:01.560
Who was that from that you'd
run out all of a sudden?

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:04.150
What do you want to do for the next game?

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:07.070
Ronaldo. Please, at least
try to put up a fight.

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:09.820
You don't have to tell me that.

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:13.490
I'll put my life on the line to beat you
if I have to, damn bastard!

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:21.420
"More Ridiculous Hunter Guild"

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:21.420
Oh my, you're suddenly fired up, huh?

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:23.500
"More Ridiculous Hunter Guild"

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:23.500
Something's come up, and I can't lose now.

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:28.760
Did you finally realize my importance?
Your brain's a little slow, Ronaldo.

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:31.840
Sand! Don't just hit me
without saying anything!

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:34.350
I don't care about appearances anymore!

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:36.310
So what do you want to do
for the next event?

00:15:36.310 --> 00:15:37.140
Marksmanship.

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:39.730
Oh, is he choosing what he's good at now?

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:43.060
He doesn't care about appearances,
but he's still following the rules, huh?

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:48.740
I'm a hunter, too, you know.
I know how to use a gun.

00:15:48.740 --> 00:15:51.570
I have prepared targets and
a gun that can be used indoors.

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:54.370
Why do you have all that?

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:56.330
Now, start!

00:15:57.490 --> 00:16:00.080
H-He fired in no time and got
the bullseye for all of them!

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:01.830
He's finally getting serious!

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:05.090
He isn't called "Ronaldo
the Peerless" for nothing!

00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:06.340
Oh, he's a little embarrassed.

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:07.090
He is!

00:16:07.090 --> 00:16:09.260
He's not used to being praised, as usual.

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:10.760
Shut up, bystanders!

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:13.550
What was that earlier, anyway?
You weren't trying to win!

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:15.470
We're betting here! Put up a fight!

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:17.390
By the way, I bought <i>The Ronaldo</i>
<i>Chronicles </i>volume 2.

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:18.140
Oh, me, too.

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:21.100
Be quiet, idiots! But thanks
for your patronage!

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:23.230
Banter with the audience
is also fun during a match.

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:25.190
It's suddenly gotten more exciting!

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:27.020
What're you doing, bastard?!

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:32.030
I don't know what happened,
but I can't win now without a plan.

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:36.780
It's so I can get Little Draluc.
I'm gonna get serious, too.

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:38.410
X.

00:16:38.410 --> 00:16:40.500
What will you have for the next match?

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:46.000
Let's see... A game I'm good at that
Ronaldo seems like he'd be bad at...

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.290
Twister!

00:16:47.290 --> 00:16:48.500
You idiot!

00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:51.010
Here's a jumbo Twister mat for adults.

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:53.340
Why do you have something
like that lying around?!

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:54.590
--This Twister mat is an item my wife and I
made many dazzling memories on...

00:16:54.590 --> 00:16:56.340
--Oh, my. I'm going to lose.
--This Twister mat is an item my wife and I
made many dazzling memories on...

00:16:56.340 --> 00:16:59.060
--Right?
--This Twister mat is an item my wife and I
made many dazzling memories on...

00:16:59.060 --> 00:17:01.600
Oh, the memories are making me excited.

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:03.230
Master, calm down!

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:05.600
Now, rings of four colors have appeared.

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:08.770
What kinds of movements
will Ronaldo show us?

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:11.030
You should just stay dead, moron!

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:13.150
Sand!

00:17:13.150 --> 00:17:15.990
Come, shall we fight, Ronaldo?

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:18.120
I'll show you, idiot!

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:21.240
Oh, my, his eyes are serious.

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:27.330
A man has fights that he can't lose!

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:29.540
I don't want to go back inside the maiden!

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:31.670
The may-what?

00:17:31.670 --> 00:17:35.590
Now, let us begin.
I will read out the colors.

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:39.100
Senya, right foot, green!

00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:43.020
Ronaldo, right foot, blue!

00:17:44.310 --> 00:17:46.480
Senya, right hand, yellow!

00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:47.310
Right!

00:17:47.310 --> 00:17:50.110
Ronaldo, left foot, yellow!

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:52.400
Senya, left foot, blue!

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:55.490
Ronaldo, right hand, blue!
Senya, left hand, blue!

00:17:55.490 --> 00:17:58.570
Ronaldo, left hand, green!

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:00.950
It already looks like hell over there.

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:04.700
Senya, left foot, green!
Ronaldo, left hand, green!

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:08.460
Senya, right foot, blue!
Ronaldo, right foot, blue!

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:11.710
Senya, left hand, green!
Ronaldo, right hand, blue!

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:15.300
Senya, right hand, red!
Ronaldo, left foot, yellow!

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:17.340
Both players are holding out
longer than expected.

00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:20.010
And so, hell is also getting dragged out!

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:25.020
How much longer do we have to watch
this game of Twister between two men?

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:28.140
Both players, right hand, green!

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:31.230
Oh, dear, are they both in trouble?

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:34.400
Not bad. Is it a draw?

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:36.440
Huh? You've gotta be kidding me.

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:38.610
The half-hearted word "draw"

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:41.990
isn't in the dictionary
of Ronaldo the Great!

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:44.450
Ronaldo does it!

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:46.870
I'm more flexible than I thought!

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:48.960
His catchphrase is lame, though!

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:51.080
A stunning upset!

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:55.170
Ronaldo wins the Twister
game, too! All right!

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:57.760
This is what you get when you
go up against Ronaldo the Great!

00:18:57.760 --> 00:19:00.090
I'm glad I didn't strain my back!

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:03.470
Ronaldo, you switched what you should
say out loud and in your head again.

00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:06.470
--Congratulations! Please do your best
in the last match, too, for my sa--

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:09.060
--Thanks, man!
--Congratulations! Please do your best
in the last match, too, for my sa--

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:11.150
Now, it's the last match, right?

00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:13.820
I'd like it to be an event
that's fair for both of us.

00:19:13.820 --> 00:19:17.690
Ronaldo, please make it
a match you can win.

00:19:17.690 --> 00:19:20.950
All right. How about Knock Down the Pole?

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:25.950
Wait, can't Little Draluc cheat like that?

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:29.120
Yeah, that's true.

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:37.210
The commentary will now be
done by me, the guild master.

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:39.970
Now, the final match in
the Battle for Draluc!

00:19:39.970 --> 00:19:41.840
Senya vs. Ronaldo!

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:44.220
Vampire Knock Down the Pole
Without Honor or Humanity!

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:45.510
Fight!

00:19:45.510 --> 00:19:49.180
I won't lose, Ronaldo.

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:53.230
Going first is Senya. With a quick attack,
he takes a large pile of ashes.

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:56.940
It's like he's tearing down a grave.

00:19:56.940 --> 00:20:00.780
Sorry, but I'm not going to
let you have this, Senya.

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:07.370
Against that, Ronaldo stretches out his
arms to take ashes from the other side.

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:10.370
It's not only a cheap shot,
it's also boring!

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:13.540
I feel bad you had to resort to
a cheap trick, but it's no use.

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:17.340
I'll show you... the difference
in our strength!

00:20:17.340 --> 00:20:19.760
Oh, my, Senya's attacked!

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:22.630
Well? You can surrender if you want.

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:25.300
<i>I'll </i>be the one to show <i>you</i>...

00:20:30.730 --> 00:20:33.980
...Ronaldo the Great's true power!

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:37.690
Wh-What?! Ronaldo returned the favor!

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:40.280
This idiot and I are a team!

00:20:40.280 --> 00:20:43.490
I know just how much of
him can be taken away!

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:48.490
Now, let's see you try
and take more--if you can!

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:57.380
I... have lost!

00:20:57.380 --> 00:21:00.670
Winner... Ronaldo!

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:05.640
Justice wins in the end.

00:21:05.640 --> 00:21:07.430
Huh?

00:21:07.430 --> 00:21:09.890
The cross is stuck to the table, though...

00:21:09.890 --> 00:21:12.730
Hey, when you were thumping
that around earlier...

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:13.810
Gulp!

00:21:13.810 --> 00:21:15.020
You cheater!

00:21:15.020 --> 00:21:15.850
Idiot!

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:18.520
Sh-Shut up! I'm done with this charade!

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:20.820
So that's how it was, Ronaldo.

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:23.280
Huh? No, that's...

00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:25.530
Put another way,
it was a surprise victory!

00:21:25.530 --> 00:21:27.200
"Put another way"?

00:21:27.200 --> 00:21:30.450
You cared so much about Little Draluc that
you would go through that much trouble!

00:21:30.450 --> 00:21:31.450
N-N-No, that's not it!

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:34.910
I didn't know you were so passionate!

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:40.710
It's been a long time since my heart
fluttered for anyone other than a vampire!

00:21:40.710 --> 00:21:44.220
W-W-Wait... Senya...

00:21:44.220 --> 00:21:48.050
Now... put these clothes on!

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:51.680
This must be where I say
"serves you right."

00:21:51.680 --> 00:21:53.560
Would you like something to drink?

00:21:53.560 --> 00:21:56.560
One glass of hot milk.
Put it on Ronaldo's tab.

00:22:01.360 --> 00:22:03.440
"Born during the time
between day and night"

00:22:01.360 --> 00:22:03.440
You, who are descended
from my compatriot...

00:22:04.570 --> 00:22:07.160
I will give you what you desire.

00:22:07.160 --> 00:22:10.910
This guy's... a dhampir, right?

00:22:12.740 --> 00:22:16.080
The vampire dies in no time.
